{"id":"17aa09872f","t":"The Primal Hunter","c":"cv","n":61,"l":119,"s":["mg"],"k":{"mg":"the-primal-hunter"},"u":1795135199581,"desc":"جيك، الذي يبدو وكأنه موظف مكتب عادي، يجد نفسه بشكل غير متوقع مدفوعًا إلى عالم خيالي يعج بالمخاطر والفرص. بدلاً من الاستسلام للخوف، يزدهر جيك في هذا العالم غير المألوف. أثناء تنقله في الكون المتعدد الممتد، تنمو قوته ويتحول – ويتطور من عامل مكتب عادي إلى صياد محترف حقيقي. اقرأ مانهوا The Primal Hunter مترجمة بالكامل بأعلى جودة على مانجا تايم (MangaTime). تابع أحدث الفصول الحصرية فور نزولها على موقعنا.","type":"مانهوا","status":"مستمر","genres":["أكشن","فانتازيا","مغامرات"],"src":{"mg":"the-primal-hunter"},"chapters":{"1":{"mg":"the-primal-hunter|"},"2":{"mg":"the-primal-hunter|"},"5":{"mg":"the-primal-hunter|"},"6":{"mg":"the-primal-hunter|"},"17":{"mg":"the-primal-hunter|"},"22":{"mg":"the-primal-hunter|"},"25":{"mg":"the-primal-hunter|"},"26":{"mg":"the-primal-hunter|"},"29":{"mg":"the-primal-hunter|"},"30":{"mg":"the-primal-hunter|"},"35":{"mg":"the-primal-hunter|"},"36":{"mg":"the-primal-hunter|"},"37":{"mg":"the-primal-hunter|"},"38":{"mg":"the-primal-hunter|"},"39":{"mg":"the-primal-hunter|"},"40":{"mg":"the-primal-hunter|"},"41":{"mg":"the-primal-hunter|"},"42":{"mg":"the-primal-hunter|"},"43":{"mg":"the-primal-hunter|"},"44":{"mg":"the-primal-hunter|"},"45":{"mg":"the-primal-hunter|"},"46":{"mg":"the-primal-hunter|"},"47":{"mg":"the-primal-hunter|"},"48":{"mg":"the-primal-hunter|"},"49":{"mg":"the-primal-hunter|"},"50":{"mg":"the-primal-hunter|"},"51":{"mg":"the-primal-hunter|"},"52":{"mg":"the-primal-hunter|"},"53":{"mg":"the-primal-hunter|"},"54":{"mg":"the-primal-hunter|"},"55":{"mg":"the-primal-hunter|"},"56":{"mg":"the-primal-hunter|"},"57":{"mg":"the-primal-hunter|"},"59":{"mg":"the-primal-hunter|"},"60":{"mg":"the-primal-hunter|"},"63":{"mg":"the-primal-hunter|"},"68":{"mg":"the-primal-hunter|"},"71":{"mg":"the-primal-hunter|"},"74":{"mg":"the-primal-hunter|"},"75":{"mg":"the-primal-hunter|"},"78":{"mg":"the-primal-hunte